            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mkstevens09"
            },
            "reviewBody": "All I can say is... WOW! These were really good in my opinion. While I don't entirely dislike Brussels Sprouts as a rule, I can't say I normally make them often. This recipe could help to change that! \n\nI soaked the sprouts in salt water for 1 hour prior to cooking. For the jerk seasoning, I used a recipe from this website. I also followed the advice of another reviewer and added a little water near the end of the cooking time and then covered the pan for a bit in order to steam them and make sure they were fully cooked and tender.",
            "datePublished": "2011-07-23T09:58:04.373Z"
          },
